# Compose image rebuild after pull

`web` and `collector` run from image `stagehand:local` with **no source bind-mount**. `docker compose restart` keeps the old baked-in code.

```text
# ❌
git pull && docker compose restart collector

# ✅
git pull
docker compose build collector
docker compose up -d --force-recreate collector
```

Rebuild `web` the same way when template/view code changes.
